  "raw_text_preview": "ME1 \u2013 B.Tech. in Mechanical Engineering\nB.Tech. in Mechanical Engineering\nMechanical Engineering, Department of\nProgramme Code: ME1\nB. Tech.\nOverall Credit Structure\nCourse Category Credits\nBS (Basic Sciences)\n24\nGE (General Engineering)\n24\nHS (Humanities and Social Sciences)\n15\nDC (Departmental Core)\n64\nDE (Departmental Electives)\n18\nOC (Open Category)\n9\nTotal Graded Credit Requirement\n154\nNon-Graded Units (NGU) Units\nLife skills\n2\nEnglish language learning\n2\nDepartmental project, internship experience\n2\nNCC / NSO / NSS\n2\nTotal Non-Graded Units\n8\nProgramme Learning Outcomes\nPLO Outcome\nPLO 1\nBe able to use the principles of conservation to design, develop and analyze mechanical engineering systems to address industry and society needs.\nPLO 2\nDemonstrate skills to model mechanical engineering systems to facilitate their design for safe, efficient and sustainable operation.\nPLO 3\nDemonstrate the ability to use mechanical engineering skills to address interdisciplinary technological problems.\nPLO 4\nBe able to design effective man-machine interfaces.\nPLO 5\nPossess the ethical awareness and reasoning skills to consider the societal and environmental impact of engineering solutions.\nBasic Science Core\nCourse No.\nCourse Title\nL\nT\nP\nCredits\nMTL1001 Mathematics I Calculus 3 1 0 4\nPYL1001 Introduction to Electrodynamics 2 1 0 3\nPYP1000 Physics Laboratory 0 0 4 2\nMTL1002 Mathematics II Linear Algebra and Differential Equations 3 1 0 4\nCMP1000 Chemistry Laboratory 0 0 4 2\nSBP1100 Experimental Biology for Engineers 0 0 2 1\nGeneral Engineering Core\nCourse No.\nCourse Title\nL\nT\nP\nCredits\nCOL1000 Introduction to Programming 3 0 2 4\nELL1000 Introduction to Electrical Engineering 2 1 2 4\nMEP1000 Engineering Visualization 0.5 0 3 2\nMEP1001 Manufacturing for Product Innovation 0.5 0 3 2\nMLL1001 Introduction to Materials Science and Engineering 3 0 2 4\nMTL2008 Introduction to Probability and Statistics 3 1 0 4\nDepartmental Core\nCourse No.\nCourse Title\nL\nT\nP\nCredits\nMED4001 B.Tech Project (BTP) - I \u2013 \u2013 \u2013 \u2013\nMEL1002 Engineering Mechanics 3 1 0 4\nMEL2001 Solid Mechanics 3 0 2 4"
